data_nbte2
# Phase identity: ambient distorted 1T'' NbTe2, C2/m, conventional Brown cell.
# Provenance: Brown, Acta Cryst. 20, 264--267 (1966), COD 2310357 (CC0).
# This P1 representation explicitly expands the reported 2a, 4i, and 4j sites.
# The weakly bonded layers are normal to reciprocal (001) in this exact setting;
# indices from the smaller vendor setting must not be mixed with this cell.
# Limiting checks: V=abc sin(beta), 6Nb+12Te, and finite basal (001) coupling.
# Validation: nbte2-c2m-structure
